This is probably the **most important next step**.

Currently:

```text
ESP32
 ↓
Firebase
 ↓
Node 001 = REAL

Node 002 = MOCK
Node 003 = MOCK
Node 004 = MOCK
```

For your final system:

```text
ESP32 Node 001 ─┐
ESP32 Node 002 ─┤
ESP32 Node 003 ─┤
ESP32 Node 004 ─┤
                ↓
        Firebase Realtime DB
                ↓
       React Application
          ↙           ↘
      PUBLIC       AUTHORITY
```

For the current prototype, **one real ESP32 is completely okay**.

But the code architecture should be designed for multiple nodes.

