# 25. ESP32 → Firebase → Dashboard

The most important live flow should become:

```text
              ESP32
                │
        ┌───────┴────────┐
        │                │
     Sensors          Edge AI
        │                │
        └───────┬────────┘
                ↓
         Risk Decision
                ↓
       ┌────────┴────────┐
       │                 │
  Local Alert        Firebase
 Buzzer/LCD/LED          │
                         ↓
                ┌────────┴────────┐
                │                 │
             PUBLIC            AUTHORITY
```

So if Firebase goes down:

```text
ESP32
 ↓
Edge AI
 ↓
Local decision
 ↓
Buzzer/LED/LCD
```

still works.

That is important for your **Edge AI requirement**.

