# 27. Security

Even though the public doesn't need login, **authority absolutely needs authentication**.

Use Firebase Authentication:

```text
Public
   ↓
No Login
   ↓
Public Pages

Authority
   ↓
Firebase Login
   ↓
Role Check
   ↓
Authority Dashboard
```

And Firebase Rules should prevent normal users from writing/modifying sensor data.

